<title>GERMANY: German trade makes no intervention grain bids Germ.</title>
<headline>German trade makes no intervention grain bids Germ.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders made no bids for intervention grain exports to third countries on Thursday, state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>The bids would have gone to the weekly EU cereals manager meeting later on today.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
